OL,3,GNEWSAGirl's tumour diagnosis prompts
OL,4,A'village of support'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a two-year-old girl said
OL,7,Fit "felt like the room was empty" after
OL,8,Fher daughter was diagnosed with a brain
OL,9,Ftumour - but now says they have a
OL,10,F"whole village of support" after a
OL,11,Fgroup climbed Mount Snowdon in support
OL,12,Fof her.
OL,14,FOlivia, from Bexhill in East Sussex,
OL,15,Fwas diagnosed with the tumour shortly
OL,16,Fafter her first birthday, requiring
OL,17,Femergency surgery and leaving her blind
OL,18,Fin one eye, and with limited vision in
OL,19,Fthe other.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
