OL,3,GNEWSAGirl's tumour diagnosis prompts
OL,4,A'village of support'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOlivia's parents Amy and Josh say they
OL,7,Fwant to raise awareness of the need for
OL,8,Fresearch into rare paediatric brain
OL,9,Ftumours.
OL,11,FAmy said: "It's so difficult, but
OL,12,FOlivia makes it a lot easier because
OL,13,Fshe is such a happy child, and so
OL,14,Fbouncy throughout it all.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
